---
const parts = [
  {
    n: '1',
    title: 'Done',
    body: 'What changed, test results, and a screenshot if the UI changed.',
  },
  {
    n: '2',
    title: 'Why',
    body: 'The reason for the change and any context worth keeping.',
  },
  {
    n: '3',
    title: 'Next',
    body: 'What to do next, or a Needs you tag when the agent is blocked on a decision.',
  },
];
---

<section>
  <div class="anatomy">
    <div>
      <h2>How updates work</h2>
      <p class="section-intro anatomy-intro">
        Connect your coding tools once, then keep using them as usual. When an agent finishes a
        task, it posts a short three-part update over local MCP or the CLI.
      </p>
      <ul class="anatomy-points">
        {
          parts.map((part) => (
            <li>
              <span class="anatomy-tag">{part.n}</span>
              <div>
                <strong>{part.title}</strong>
                <span>{part.body}</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="feed-mock" aria-label="Example Feeder update card">
      <div class="feed-mock-head">
        <div class="feed-mock-left">
          <span class="mini-orb orb-teal" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="feed-mock-proj">Orbit</span>
          <span class="feed-mock-meta">· Claude Code</span>
        </div>
        <span class="feed-mock-meta">2m ago</span>
      </div>
      <span class="branch-pill">feat/onboarding</span>
      <div class="update-blocks">
        <div class="update-block">
          <div class="update-block-label">Shipped</div>
          <p>
            The new onboarding flow, three screens instead of seven, with progress saved between
            launches (<strong>42/42</strong> tests pass).
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="update-block">
          <div class="update-block-label">Why</div>
          <p>Most people who quit did it on screen four of the old flow.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="update-block">
          <div class="update-block-label">Next</div>
          <p>Watch day-one retention for a week before touching the paywall.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feed-mock-foot">
        <span class="status-badge working">
          <span class="pulse-dot"></span>Working · Polishing welcome animation
        </span>
        <span>Reply · Copy · Edit</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .anatomy {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .anatomy-intro {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .anatomy-points {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .anatomy-points li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 28px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .anatomy-tag {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    margin-top: 1px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 650;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .anatomy-points strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
  .anatomy-points span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.48;
  }

  .feed-mock {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 22px 24px 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }
  .feed-mock-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 14px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .feed-mock-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .feed-mock-proj {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .feed-mock-meta {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .branch-pill {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    font: 12px/1.3 ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', monospace;
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--mono-bg);
    padding: 3px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .update-blocks {
    margin-top: 14px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .update-block-label {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .update-block p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .update-block strong {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .feed-mock-foot {
    margin-top: 16px;
    padding-top: 14px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .status-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 550;
  }
  .status-badge.working {
    background: var(--green-soft);
    color: var(--green);
  }
  .pulse-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: currentColor;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .anatomy {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .feed-mock {
      padding: 18px;
    }
  }
</style>
